**CodeEditor** wraps [@monaco-editor/react](https://github.com/suren-atoyan/monaco-react) — the Monaco Editor that powers VS Code. `wrapCompound` handles it the same way as Slider and Knob: the render component is ~60 lines of pure React, the config is ~15 lines.

Edit the markdown below and watch the rendered preview update in real time.
]]>
